WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:02.810
Uchimura-kun!

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.980
In the second round of the district tournament,

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:11.650
we, the Momoyama Predators, defeated Tsubakimori SC 6-2.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.870
We decided to celebrate the victory by having a yakiniku party, but...

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:19.990
Hello.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.710
Reika-chan!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.670
Mama! Why are you here?

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.800
Mama!

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:06.060
I called the piano teacher and she said that you took a break from lessons.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:11.470
I asked Matsushima-san and she said you were playing soccer secretly.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:13.320
That surprised me.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.860
What if you get hurt playing this dangerous sport?

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.660
I won't allow you to play soccer!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.340
Please wait!

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.680
Reika-chan is an important member of the team!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.830
Please let her play soccer!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.540
I'm sorry.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.590
Reika-chan is the heir of the Saionji family.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.950
I want her to do what's proper for her.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.720
I'll have her stop playing soccer starting today.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.100
Come on, Reika-chan. Let's go home.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.370
O-Okay.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.700
Reika-chan...

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:48.010
Is that really okay?

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.280
Yes.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.560
I'm sorry.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.040
What should we do?

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.910
If Saionji-san quits, we won't have enough people.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:06.030
I'll go and get her back right now!

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.910
Stop that.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.110
Coach.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.580
This is her own family's problem.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.040
She needs to solve this herself.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.370
No way.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.510
Reika-chan...

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.670
Good morning, Reika-chan.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:35.600
I've been doing a lot of research since then.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.650
These are the sports I think will fit you more.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.560
Look! Golf is getting popular lately.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.910
Swimming looks good, too.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:49.660
You may even meet someone amazing in tennis.

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.960
No, I...

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.610
I'm thinking about you, Reika-chan.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:00.630
How can a wonderful lady play soccer?

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.510
You need to learn something more suited for your status.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.420
Oh, it's time already.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.720
I need to get prepared for the tea party.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.330
Later, Reika-chan.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.930
I've made arrangements already.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:16.040
Come with me after school to see what you like.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:17.860
Mama!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:28.370
Milady, you'll be late if you don't eat breakfast now.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.180
Matsushima-san.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.380
I couldn't sleep last night.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.170
I'm not going to school today.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.670
Reika-chan didn't come to school today.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.940
All that happened yesterday, you know.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.850
There's one more pudding left!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.270
Yes! Let's split it between us!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.230
Hey! This is Reika-chan's!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.900
She took the day off! Give that back!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.930
Are you her classmates!?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:06.410
Worry about Reika-chan for a second!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.070
Oh, shut up!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.460
Hey, Erika-chan. Coach Hanashima told us not to interfere,

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.390
but I'm still worried about Reika-chan.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.750
Me, too.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.590
Let's go see her after class.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.140
Woo-hoo! What? The married couple is paying a visit?

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.400
It's getting hot in here!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.050
What are you two saying!?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.270
Milady, it's time for lunch.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.880
Sorry. I have no appetite.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.300
I've finished the laundry.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:52.500
Matsushima-san, why did you tell Mama?

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:56.750
We promised to keep this a secret! 
You know Mama would be against it.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:05.260
Milady, I told your mother the truth because I knew it would come to this someday.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.160
You can't keep on lying forever.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.410
Please think this through one more time.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:15.010
What are your true feelings?

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.530
You're pretty good at soccer!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:32.780
Really?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.740
Nice to meet all of you.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.830
Thank you very much.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.160
It's so far away.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.970
Are we there yet?

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.910
No way!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:07.310
Milady, your friends are here.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.230
We're here, Reika-chan!

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.490
Excuse me.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.410
Milady?

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:21.330
Reika is gone?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:25.640
She tricked her maid and left without telling her!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.940
This is the first time this has happened!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.380
I see.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.630
I haven't seen her at practice, either.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.870
Then where did she go?

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:35.750
Isn't she at <i>that</i> place?{Over there, probably? }

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.890
Oh yeah! There!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.160
Zach!

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.240
Found you, Reika-chan!

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.510
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.510
I took a day off from school.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.520
No, that's fine.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.670
Why are you here by yourself?

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.900
If I stay in that house any longer,

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:09.840
I'll have to go check out other sports like tennis or swimming with Mama.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.880
Why don't you just say no?

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.090
That's not possible.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:20.530
Mama wants me to become the proper heir to the 
Saionji family, so she pushes me to learn many things.

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.890
I never wanted to do any of that.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.660
Mama always decides things by herself without asking me.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.610
So that's why you snuck out?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.780
Are you quitting soccer?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.660
I don't know.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.080
But Mama won't let me play.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.750
Were you lying when you said you loved soccer?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.710
I love soccer!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:51.590
I have nothing to say to someone who is quitting just because her parents told her to quit.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.220
Kota-kun! That's going too far!{That's saying too much! }

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.140
Reika-chan, I have a great idea!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.850
You should just run away from home!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:05.310
Hey! Wait! Erika-chan?

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.440
Yes. Yes, I'm really sorry.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.020
Yes.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.360
Excuse me.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:18.610
Matsushima-san, the maid, told me that she'll tell your mother.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.450
You'll be fine for tonight.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.410
Yes! That's great!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.130
Will Mama let me do this?

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:36.970
Matsushima-san, where's Reika? Have you found her yet?

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:41.270
Ma'am, Milady won't be returning home tonight.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:44.180
She's staying with a friend.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.900
Reika-chan? That won't do.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.770
Where is she staying? I need to go pick her up.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:56.450
Ma'am. I broke my promise with Milady yesterday.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.490
I will not let you go today.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.580
Matsushima-san!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:07.000
This is for her own sake. Please forgive me.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.710
I see.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:14.000
You left home because your family won't let you play soccer. That's tough.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:20.640
Um, was anyone here against Erika-chan playing soccer when she started out?

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.810
I was against it at first.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:27.410
But you know, when she sets her sight on something, nothing will stop her.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.450
She wouldn't stop no matter what I say, so I gave up.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.020
Well, she's been boorish since she was little, so it fits her well.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.480
Yes, yes.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:38.820
Hey! Boorish? More like active!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.620
Here, don't be shy. Have seconds.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:45.330
O-Okay. Thank you.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.630
What a refined lady! It's like night and day compared to our Erika.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.580
No wait, more like the Tsuutenkaku compared to a furnace chimney.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.210
What did you say? And who's the father of that furnace chimney!?

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.510
I-It's not good to fight.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.720
We're not fighting.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.680
That's right. It's always like this.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.590
Here you go, Erika-chan. A big bowl.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:10.300
Thank you very much.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:13.260
Stop that, you two. It's embarrassing.

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:15.370
You're troubling Reika-chan.{Reika-chan's laughing at you two. }

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.920
Don't worry about it. That's who we are. Right?

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.000
Yeah, yeah. Well said!

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.000
Yep! Hahaha!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.410
Erika-chan, thank you.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.000
Don't worry about it. We're friends.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:43.260
If only Mama can agree to me playing soccer like your parents, then I can keep on playing.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:47.760
Reika-chan, are you really quitting soccer?

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:51.310
I really don't know.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.310
I see.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:57.610
Actually, there was a time when I was thinking about quitting like you.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.980
Eh?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:04.950
Should I keep on playing on a boys team or join a girls team?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.930
But I've decided.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.520
It's no use worrying.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:15.710
If you're worried, then just do whatever you want then!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.170
Whatever I want...

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:23.200
Reika-chan, we're actually the same.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:26.070
We help out our mothers and we try to convince them.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:28.720
In the end, they agree to let us play soccer.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.680
Erika-chan.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:34.840
Just think about it again tonight and then go talk to your mother about it.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:37.360
I'll go with you after practice.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.610
Okay.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.220
Good night, then.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.490
Good night.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:19.100
Saionji-san! You can keep on playing soccer?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.270
That's great!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.920
Sorry. We actually don't know what's going to happen.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.330
We're thinking of going to convince her mother after this.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:33.540
Ryuuji-kun has a good way with his words.
 We want to bring him along, but he's not here?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.790
The three of them are late, it seems.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.390
I see.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.350
Is there anything we can do?

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.800
Hey, all of you.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.630
There's no need for all that anymore.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.390
Reika-chan!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.760
Mama!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.390
She contacted me yesterday.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.400
She wanted to have your mother see you practice.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.230
M-Matsushima-san!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.870
Six people here?

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:09.030
Reika, if you're fine with it, we can have a 3 on 3 mini game.{Reika, we can have a 3 on 3 minigame with you. }

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.070
E-Eh? O-Okay!

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:15.240
No! I won't agree on having her do something so dangerous!

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:19.540
I've been up all night yesterday worrying about her!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.830
Mama...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.920
Please think about what you really want to do.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.300
Just do what you want to do!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.910
That's right.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.890
Mama, I'm sorry for making you worry yesterday.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.640
I'm sorry for playing soccer behind your back.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.100
Reika-chan?

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:45.130
You are always thinking about me.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.780
I understand that you are always pushing me to learn many things.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:53.600
But soccer is the first thing I've wanted to do on my own.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:57.080
I love soccer! I don't want to quit!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.790
Reika-chan...

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:06.170
Please! If I can score a goal in this mini game, then let me continue playing soccer.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.050
I'm asking you, too!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.890
I want to play soccer with Reika!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.110
Please let her play soccer!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.210
Erika-chan...

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.540
Me, too.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:24.660
Reika-chan has been practicing very hard. She's put in much more than I have.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.920
She's really doing her best!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:29.730
That's why! Please!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.950
Shou-kun...

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.810
Even if you tell me that...

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:39.620
Ma'am, Milady comes home every day with her jersey full of mud.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:43.730
Please see her true self!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.730
Even you, too?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.370
What's the matter with all of you?

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.960
I guess it can't be helped.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:55.220
All right. Just this time.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.280
Mama!

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.680
Thank you very much!

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.770
Okay, let's get started!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:04.140
Okay.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:10.670
Listen up. I won't go easy for you!

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.070
I won't lose, either!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:16.080
Reika, this time you won't just be playing defense.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.150
Try to attack as much as you can.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:18.790
Okay!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.750
Don't worry. We'll assist you as much as possible.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.750
Leave that to us.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.880
I must attack as much as I can.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.970
Reika-chan!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:43.160
This won't do! She'll get hurt!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.900
Ma'am! You can't!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.190
Reika-chan.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.310
Sorry, Shou-kun.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.480
Don't worry. You're doing great.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.590
Erika-chan, can't you ease up a bit?

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.950
What are you saying!?

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:34.320
This is a fight between women!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.930
How can I go easy on her!?

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.240
We boys are on the pitch, too...{I'm on the pitch, too. }

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.270
Go!

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.350
Not over yet!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.220
Are you okay, Reika-chan?

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:15.260
T-Thank you.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.200
I just tripped a bit.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:20.620
Thank goodness.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.470
Oh? Look at her.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.900
Reika-chan... She's covered in mud!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:51.830
That's who she is. Have you seen her working so hard before?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.320
Matsushima-san...

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.050
The sun is setting.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.860
Let's end this after one more play.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.320
One more play...

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.320
Listen up, Reika-chan.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:10.250
Remember all the practices and matches we had.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.830
I won't go easy on you at all!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.300
Yeah!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.900
The practices and the matches...

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.680
It's the same as that time.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:32.650
Erika-chan and her team will be tired now, having been attacking this entire time.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.020
If that's the case...

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.360
Let's go! The last ball!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.320
Erika-chan slowed down!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.050
Leave it to me!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.160
No! I can't watch this anymore!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.800
The game is still ongoing.

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:07.680
Please watch her until the very end.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:11.770
Please see how much work she has done since stepping onto the pitch.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.060
Shou-kun will definitely be over there!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.290
This is the last chance!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.280
I must pass this one to Reika-chan!{I must bring Reika-chan back! }

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.380
I love soccer!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:37.170
I don't want to quit!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.700
Reika-chan!

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.150
Go, Reika-chan!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:43.900
Ma'am!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.840
Do your best, Milady!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.110
Go, Reika-chan!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.020
Reika-chan, shoot!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.250
Where's the ball?

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.080
Reika-chan, are you okay?

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.170
Reika-chan!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.360
Sorry, Erika-chan.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.180
Sorry, everyone.

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:28.810
Reika-chan.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:29.760
Reika-chan!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.370
Mama.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.030
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:35.990
No, I'm fine.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:42.120
Thank goodness! This is the first time I've seen you like this!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:42.860
Eh?

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.280
I don't know why, but I'm really happy.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.240
Mama!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:52.170
Mrs. Saionji, don't tell me...

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:55.000
...you're allowing her to keep on playing soccer?

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:59.300
If that's what she wants, then I guess it can't be helped.

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:00.480
Mama!

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:06.810
But you can't have it affect your studies! You have to keep on playing piano, too.

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:09.390
If you can't do that, then I'll have you stop immediately!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.600
That's our promise.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.830
Okay! I promise.

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:14.100
Thank you, Mama!

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.540
Yes!

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:16.270
Yeah!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:22.230
Jeez, look at you.

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:24.570
You too, Mama.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:28.700
Oh my. You're right.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.070
Jeez, Reika-chan.

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:40.580
Ma'am, Milady, I'll wash those for you when we get back.

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:43.840
Reika-chan! Reika-chan!

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:36.870
That's great, Reika-chan.

00:24:36.870 --> 00:24:37.980
Yeah!

00:24:37.980 --> 00:24:39.580
But now is not the time for that!

00:24:39.580 --> 00:24:42.990
The next match is starting and the triplets aren't acting like themselves!{The next match is ongoing and the triplets are acting weird! }

00:24:42.990 --> 00:24:43.690
You're right.

00:24:43.690 --> 00:24:45.530
They're saying they are all elite fighters or something.

00:24:45.530 --> 00:24:48.630
Not only that! Something's weird with <i>all</i> of them!

00:24:48.630 --> 00:24:50.630
Eh? All of them?

00:24:50.630 --> 00:24:53.170
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!!

00:24:53.170 --> 00:24:54.590
Demon Extermination.
